<!--
  Stellar Provisions SN-5 专属心情思绪（ThoughtDef）
  ============================================================================
  验证状态：已验证（对照 RimWorld 1.7.5000 rev1275 原版：
    Data/Core/Defs/ThoughtDefs/Thoughts_Memory_Eating.xml
    AteFineMeal :21-34（最小 ThoughtDef 形状：durationDays + stages/li/label
    + description + baseMoodEffect）；
    durationDays 0.1 与 baseMoodEffect 3 的零食组合有第三方先例
    （Rimstro 的 AteSnack，workshop 1714572710））
  AI 辅助生成
  ============================================================================
  适用版本：RimWorld 1.7

  关键设计决策：
    1. baseMoodEffect 2 / durationDays 0.5 —— 低于精致餐(AteFineMeal +5/1 天)，
       高于无加成。零食是"安慰"，不是"满足"。
    2. 不用 thoughtClass：保持最简 ThoughtDef 形状，与 AteFineMeal/AteLavishMeal
       同构。Thought_FoodEaten 只用于"被迫吃坏东西"的负面思绪（AteRawFood 等）。
    3. 不写 showBubble/icon：原版正餐思绪也不写，默认即可。
    4. 中文文案在 Languages/ChineseSimplified/DefInjected/ThoughtDef/Thoughts_SN5.xml，
       注入键为 TST_AteSN5Crisps.stages.0.label 与 .description。
  ============================================================================
-->
<Defs>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>TST_AteSN5Crisps</defName>
    <durationDays>0.5</durationDays>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>ate a manufactured snack</label>
        <description>It is not good. It is not bad. It is exactly what it says it is, which is more than most things can manage.</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>2</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
